WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.136
On a complex SAP programme, status can become a weekly
chase

2
00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:08.496
across schedules, spreadsheets, forecasts, RAID logs and
email.

3
00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:12.680
When the signals disagree, leaders lose time debating the
report

4
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.802
instead of acting on delivery.

5
00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:17.336
Mantiva360 brings the project-control picture together.

6
00:00:17.396 --> 00:00:20.283
Plans, progress, resources, actuals, forecasts and risks

7
00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:22.817
are reviewed in one connected context.

8
00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:26.589
Start with attention. The 360 Cockpit surfaces material
findings

9
00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:29.123
and shows which dimension is affected.

10
00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:32.070
Then ask why. Follow the reason-coded condition

11
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.017
back to the governed record behind it.

12
00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:39.201
Move from cause to action. See the owner, target date,

13
00:00:39.261 --> 00:00:41.323
required outcome and expected impact.

14
00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:45.095
The team makes the change in the authorised source.

15
00:00:45.155 --> 00:00:48.042
Mantiva360 reruns deterministic health and reconciliation
checks,

16
00:00:48.102 --> 00:00:51.401
so the result is inspected rather than assumed.

17
00:00:51.461 --> 00:00:54.348
The Delivery Plan connects activities, tasks,
deliverables,

18
00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:55.645
evidence and dependencies.

19
00:00:55.705 --> 00:00:58.592
Progress follows the project's configured control method.

20
00:00:58.652 --> 00:01:01.126
Evidence and accountable assessment support confidence,

21
00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:04.898
but neither time nor cost automatically creates earned
progress.

22
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:10.319
For SAP delivery, work can be viewed in an SAP Activate
phase context

23
00:01:10.379 --> 00:01:13.266
without replacing the tools teams already use.

24
00:01:13.326 --> 00:01:16.213
Built-in health and reconciliation agents highlight
exceptions.

25
00:01:16.273 --> 00:01:19.984
Read-only AI helps authorised users understand their
project data

26
00:01:20.044 --> 00:01:21.694
and the next decision.

27
00:01:21.754 --> 00:01:24.641
Mantiva360. Know what needs attention, and why.

28
00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:28.000
Data to Progress. Learn more at mantiva360.com.
